  },
  "agents": {
    "langchain-expert": {
      "description": "LangChain / LangGraph / LangSmith / Deep Agents specialist",
      "skills": [
        "deep-agents-core",
        "deep-agents-memory",
        "deep-agents-orchestration",
        "deepagents-python-quickstart",
        "deepagents-typescript-quickstart",
        "ecosystem-primer",
        "eval-engineering",
        "langchain-dependencies",
        "langchain-fundamentals",
        "langchain-middleware",
        "langchain-python-quickstart",
        "langchain-rag",
        "langchain-typescript-quickstart",
        "langgraph-cli",
        "langgraph-fundamentals",
        "langgraph-human-in-the-loop",
        "langgraph-persistence",
        "langgraph-python-quickstart",
        "langgraph-typescript-quickstart",
        "langsmith-dataset",
        "langsmith-evaluator",
        "langsmith-online-eval-engineering",
        "langsmith-trace",
        "managed-deep-agents",
        "swarm",
        "diagnosing-bugs",
        "verification-planning",
        "tdd"
      ],
      "mcps": [
        "docs-langchain",
        "reference-langchain",
        "langsmith"
      ],
      "permission": {
        "read": "allow",
        "grep": "allow",
        "glob": "allow",
        "list": "allow",
        "lsp": "allow",
        "edit": "allow",
        "bash": {
          "*": "ask",
          "pytest*": "allow",
          "python -m pytest*": "allow",
          "uv run*": "allow",
          "pip show*": "allow",
          "git diff*": "allow",
          "git status*": "allow",
          "rm *": "deny"
        },
        "webfetch": "allow",
        "task": "deny"
      },
      "orchestratorPrompt": "@langchain-expert\n- Role: LangChain / LangGraph / LangSmith / Deep Agents specialist. Owns the LangChain skills and the docs-langchain, reference-langchain, and langsmith MCPs; no other agent has them.\n- **Delegate when:** LangChain or LangGraph code • graph/agent architecture • LangSmith traces, datasets, or evals • LangChain API uncertainty or version migration • agent runtime bugs • checkpointing/streaming/HITL/middleware/structured-output issues • Deep Agents work\n- **Don't delegate when:** ordinary Python/JS • generic web/data/infra work • non-LangChain bugs • UI work (→ @designer)\n- **Pass in the handoff** (it runs in an isolated context and cannot see this conversation): the task, repo root, relevant file paths, verbatim error text, observed vs desired behavior, LangSmith project/trace ids if any, and previous attempts.\n- It cannot delegate and cannot mutate LangSmith data; expect a report with root cause, files changed, evidence vs inference, and validation run."
    }
  }
}
